  <names>
    <name lang="en">MDT AKD-0424R.02 - 2D front</name>
    <name lang="de">MDT AKD-0424R.02 - 2D Frontansicht</name>
  </names>
  <informations>Unofficial QElectroTech conversion of original MDT manufacturer CAD drawing MDT_CAD_AKD-0424R02.dxf. Manufacturer CAD geometry and logos retained. Original rights remain with MDT technologies GmbH. Colored front assembly thumbnail with reconstructed green terminals and screw heads. Not a wiring symbol. CAD overall envelope: 72 x 91.3549 mm including latch. Scale 2 QET units/mm. Source: https://www.mdt.de/fileadmin/user_upload/user_upload/download/MDT_CAD_mdt_catalog.zip</informations>
  <elementInformations>
